SUMMARY:Broadway Bound! Camp at Dutch Apple Dinner Theatre (Advanced)
DESCRIPTION:Advanced: Freak Friday the Musical (Audition only; all ages)\nMonday – Friday Mornings 9:00am – 12:00pm | Saturday Morning Performance \nParticipants must audition for consideration. Auditions / Callbacks will be held on April 11 & 12. Audition materials from the show will be provided. Audition sign ups will be available in early March. Please contact BroadwayBound@dutchapple.com with any questions. \nRehearsals: \nJune 22\, 23\, 24\, 25\, 26 9am-1pm (Bring a snack\, water bottle) \nJune 29\, 30\, July 1\, 2\, 3\, 6\, 7 10am-5pm (Bring a packed lunch\, snack\, water bottle) \nJuly 9 6-9pm \nJuly 10 9am-3pm (Lunch provided) \nPerformance Dates: \nJuly 10\, 14\, 17\, 19\, 21\, 24\, 28\, 31 Aug. 1\, 4 @12:45pm
