SUMMARY:Skills Camp at Penn Medicine Park
DESCRIPTION:For young athletes ages 7 – 13 looking to take their game to the next level\, this camp focuses on all aspects of player development — hitting\, pitching\, fielding\, throwing\, and base running. \nLed by experienced coaches\, players will take part in skill-building drills\, technical instruction\, and game-like situations designed to improve performance\, confidence\, and game IQ. Whether you’re new to the game or building advanced skills\, this camp will help you grow as a well-rounded athlete both on and off the field. \nJoin us for an exciting\, skill-building baseball camp where players of all levels will enhance their abilities in every aspect of the game! Participants will focus on key fundamentals such as hitting\, pitching\, fielding\, base running\, and throwing. Through instruction from the Stormers coaching staff and fun drills\, players will progressively build their skills and gain confidence on the field\, setting the foundation for success in competitive play. Train like the Stormers! \nRuns: 9:00 am – 12:00 Noon \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/skills-camp-penn-medicine-park/
LOCATION:Penn Medicine Park\, 650 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Community Interest,Lancaster City,Outdoor Activities,Summer Camp
