SUMMARY:Kutztown Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Kutztown Fair returns this August\, offering an incredible all-inclusive value where your gate admission unlocks nearly everything on the grounds. This community tradition features free carnival rides\, free nightly face painting\, and free parking\, making it a favorite for families. \nThe entertainment lineup is packed with free music on the Main Stage and in the Beer Garden\, alongside lively country line dancing and midway shows. Beyond the thrills\, visitors can explore extensive livestock\, farm\, and craft exhibits. While most grandstand shows are free\, don’t miss the high-energy Wednesday night racing for a small additional fee! \n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/kutztown-fair/
LOCATION:Kutztown Fair\, 450 Wentz. St.\, Kutztown\, PA\, 19530\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Fairs & Festivals
