SUMMARY:Bastidas Soccer Academy Training Camp
DESCRIPTION:Established in 1999\, the Bastidas Soccer Academy emphasizes the importance of basic skill and ball mastery.  We are passionate about teaching you to have fun and develop a winning attitude. \nAll boys and girls from any school or district\, entering grades 3-8\, are invited to attend this premier camp to kick off the fall season. Registration is $200 per player (or $190 each for a sibling group) and will include: \n\nCamp T-shirt\nUSSF Licensed Coaches (including “A” License coach Trajano Bastidas) and USYS ODP Coaches\nCamp features– league play\, king of the hill\, soccer dance\, small sided games\, stations\nMain focuses– first touch\, passing\, receiving\, finishing\, having fun!\n\nPlayers should arrive at least 10 minutes early each day with proper attire\, sneakers\, cleats\, shin guards\, plenty of water\, and a snack for the mid-point break. \nQuestions? Please reach out to bastidasa@manheimcentral.org \nSee you at Camp! \n* You will see “Zeffy” on your credit card statement \n** The optional platform donation at checkout can be set to any amount\, or $0
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/bastidas-soccer-academy-training-camp/2026-08-05/
LOCATION:Manheim Central Middle School\, 261 White Oak Rd\, Manheim\, 17545\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Manheim,Outdoor Activities,Sports,Summer Camp
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Bastidas-Soccer-Camp.png
END:VEVENT
