SUMMARY:Scootin’ for Scoops with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a 5-star Lancaster County ice cream tour experience with Strasburg Scooter Tours. You’ll see rolling farmlands\, pass by horse and buggies\, and enjoy some of the best Ice Cream in Lancaster County! It’s a stark contrast to the usual fast-paced and congested areas of larger cities. For those craving something different or one of the best romantic date night ideas\, join us! \nWe designed this tour to be an experience you can share with someone. We’ll only use Scoot Coupes\, so single riders will have to look for someone to bring on the tour. It will be well worth it as you can expect exceptional views. Bond throughout the experience alongside our expert guide and relish some tasty ice cream* as we Ride around the rolling farmland surrounding the Village of Intercourse and Bird-in-Hand\, PA. \n>> Check Out Our Ice Cream Tour in Strasburg\, PA \nItinerary\nSome of our past tours have included: \n\nAn evening drive through PA Dutch Country\nBeautiful rolling farm-scapes and off-the-beaten-path adventures\nA stop at one of the best ice cream shops that Amish Country has to offer*\n\nAnd each trip is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you! \n*Unfortunately\, we regret to inform you that some of the food offerings on the tour may not be considered ‘Kosher.’ We apologize for any inconvenience.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-scootin-for-scoops/2026-08-06/
LOCATION:Strasburg Scooter Tours\, 246 N Decatur Street\, Strasburg\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Food & Beverage Events,July 4th Independence Day,Labor Day,Memorial Day Weekend,Outdoor Activities,Strasburg, Pennsylvania,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Scootin-for-Scoops.png
END:VEVENT
