SUMMARY:Markets & Makers in Lancaster City
DESCRIPTION:Each First Friday from May to October Ewell Plaza becomes a lively marketplace for local artisans! \nHeld in partnership with Pennsylvania College of Art & Design\, Markets & Makers features an arts market which provides opportunities for emerging artists to show and sell their work and arts organizations hosting free make-and-take projects for all ages. \nAll year long\, Lancaster City is host to large festivals\, cultural events\, block parties\, and more! The City of Lancaster’s special events help us celebrate both the unique cultures and communities that call Lancaster home and attract visitors to Downtown Lancaster City. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
